{"title":"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/c/2fcabe2c2b8ebe2c428830acb9874cb8a8df790f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[r]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\" /> denotes the largest integer less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/a/05a4ca8e5d8ff3259d63a136359451b642573430.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e.g.,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"32\" height=\"11\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/825d9ba2f293564a2458fd45270dfd17158cbf45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[6] = 6, [\\pi] = 3, [-1.5] = -2.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"221\" height=\"18\" /> Indicate on the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" />-plane the set of all points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/1/2019989a66ed5f3d8bc3f035ea78235365d5495b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[x]^2+[y]^2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Both <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/e/bceb7b14e55d33a8bca29b7863ad3cdae95afce4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[x]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/e/bde015c27a93628bf6263095b942c5348d9570f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[y]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"22\" height=\"20\" /> are integers. The only pairs of integers whose squares sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by testing are just <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e0ef68f274ec95f4a8f94eebff49accdcf689ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0c67f1e6c098104b1cb8f1cdd6bb16f689ac3e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/b/9eb3399f288c7a28ac2484b7bba72654ee4d9772.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/6525419c2f6d4228feb404b8627fd6b55ca142d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" />. These are the floors, so the solutions are the set of four unit squares on the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" /> plane whose bottom-left corners are one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e0ef68f274ec95f4a8f94eebff49accdcf689ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0c67f1e6c098104b1cb8f1cdd6bb16f689ac3e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/b/9eb3399f288c7a28ac2484b7bba72654ee4d9772.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/6525419c2f6d4228feb404b8627fd6b55ca142d7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Eevee9406\">eevee9406</a>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO\">1975 Canadian MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 8\">8</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_Canadian_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1975 Canadian MO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017171947\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 110/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 915/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 52/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3525/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.548      1 Template:Old_CanadaMO_box_(6-8_Problems)/8\n100.00%    6.548      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:15103:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017171947 and revision id 282716. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}